<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Suuki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Annabi Sulemani xa suuki fisamante</para>
  <para style="toc2">Suuki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Suu</para>
  <para style="mt">Annabi Sulemani xa suuki fisamante</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Sulemani, naxan nu findixi Isirayila mangɛ ra a baba Dawuda dangi xanbi, a nu bara kitaabui ndee sɛbɛ Ala xa lɔnni xa fe ra. Alatala nu bara fe gbegbe masen a bɛ a xa mangɛya kui, naxee bara findi lɔnni xungbe ra duniɲa birin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi kitaabui kui, Ala bara lɔnni mɔɔli gbɛtɛ masen Sulemani bɛ, naxan findixi xanunteya ra xɛmɛ nun ginɛ tagi. Tawureta Munsa a masenma won bɛ, Alatala to xɛmɛ daa, a naxa a to a hayi nu na ginɛ ma. A naxa e firin daa alako e xa kafu e booree ra, e xa wuya. Na kui won a kolonma xanunteya naxan na xɛmɛ nun ginɛ tagi, a findixi Ala sago nan na. Xa a sa li xɛmɛ, xa na mu a ra ginɛ, a wama na fe mɔɔli xɔn futi mu na naxan na, na tɛmui a bara findi yunubi ra. Yɛnɛ mu rafan Ala ma, kɔnɔ futi xirife xɛmɛ nun ginɛ tagi, Alatala yati nan na yamarixi.</para>
  <para style="ip">«Sulemani xa suuki fisamante» a na birin masenma taali wɔyɛnyi ra. Xɛmɛ wama ginɛ xɔn, ginɛ fan wama xɛmɛ xɔn. E bara e boore xanu han e wama lufe yire keren tun. Na xanunteya mɔɔli mu ɲaaxu. Ala wama na xɔn mixie bɛ naxee bara natɛ tongo e xa futi xiri. Ala fe naxan daaxi, na mu nɔma findide yunubi ra xa a rawalima a rawali ki ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa na sɛriyɛ masen won bɛ, alako won xa lu sɛniyɛnyi kui alɔ Alatala wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Annabi Sulemani xa suuki fisamante</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="SNG 1" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛ xanuxi xa ɲɛlɛxinyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 1:1" />Annabi Sulemani xa suuki fisamante nan ya:<verse eid="SNG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi a xanuntenyi bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 1:2" />«I xa n masunbu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:2">I xa xanunteya ɲɔxun wɛni bɛ.<verse eid="SNG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 1:3" />I xiri ɲɔxunmɛ luxi nɛ alɔ labundɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">naxan xiri fanyi minima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">Na nan a ra i rafan ginɛdimɛ birin ma.<verse eid="SNG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 1:4" />I xa n tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">won xa siga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Mangɛ xa n xanin a xɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 1:4">Ginɛdimɛe xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">I xa fe na a niyama won xa lu sɛɛwɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">I xa xanunteya ɲɔxun wɛni bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Nɔndi na mixi bɛ i rafanxi naxan ma.»<verse eid="SNG 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi ginɛdimɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 1:5" />«Darisalamu ginɛdimɛe, n kiri fɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">kɔnɔ n tofan alɔ Kedari xa kiri banxie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">alɔ dugi naxee gbakuxi Annabi Sulemani xɔnyi.<verse eid="SNG 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 1:6" />Wo naxa n kiri fɔɔrɔxi mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">soge nan n fɔɔrɔxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">N nga xa di xɛmɛe nu xɔnɔxi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">e nu n xɛɛma e xa wɛni bilie rawalide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">N mu nɔ n ɲɛngi sade n gbe xɔn ma.»<verse eid="SNG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi a xanuntenyi bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 1:7" />«N xanuntenyi, i xa a fala n bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">i xurusee dɛ madonma dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">alako n naxa lu i fen na malabui tɛmui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">i booree xa xuruse gɔɔrɛe ya ma.»<verse eid="SNG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 1:8" />«Ginɛ tofanyi fisamante,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">xa i mu na yire kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">i xa n ma yɛxɛɛe fɔxi fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">i xa i gbee dɛ madon n ma gɔɔrɛ longori ra.<verse eid="SNG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 1:9" />N xanuntenyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:9">i tofan alɔ Misira mangɛ xa soe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:9">naxan a ragise bɛndunma.<verse eid="SNG 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 1:10" />I xa tulirasoee bara i xɛrɛe ratofan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:10">i kɔnyi rayabu kɔnmagore kui.<verse eid="SNG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 1:11" />Won xa maratofan se gbɛtɛe fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:11">naxee yailanxi xɛɛma nun gbeti ra.»<verse eid="SNG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi a xa xɛmɛ xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 1:12" />«N ma labundɛ xiri nu mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:12">mangɛ xa xulunyi yire.<verse eid="SNG 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 1:13" />N xanuntenyi maniyaxi se sase nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:13">naxan gbakuxi n xiɲɛe tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:13">se xiri fanyi saxi a kui.<verse eid="SNG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 1:14" />A xiri luxi nɛ alɔ sansi fuge xiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:14">naxee kelixi wɛni bilie ya ma En Gedi bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="SNG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 1:15" />«N xanuntenyi, i tofan, i tofan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">I yae rayabu alɔ ganbɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 1:16" />«N xanuntenyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">i tofan, i tofan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">Won na dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">ɲooge fanyi bara findi won ma sade ra,<verse eid="SNG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 1:17" />sɛdiri wuri salonyie bara findi won ma banxi xunyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:17">sipirɛ wuri bara findi won ma banxi kanke ra.»<verse eid="SNG 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="SNG 2" />
  <para style="s">Xanuntenyie xa tofanyi</para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 2:1" />«N tan luma nɛ alɔ sansi fuge tofanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:1">naxan mɔɔli toma Sarɔn gulunba yire.»<verse eid="SNG 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 2:2" />«I tan luxi nɛ alɔ sansi fuge tofanyi tunbee ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:2">I tofan ginɛdimɛe birin bɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi a xa xɛmɛ xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 2:3" />«N xanuntenyi luxi nɛ alɔ mangoe bili wondi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">A fan sɛgɛtalae birin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">N bara wa lufe a xa niini bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">a xa fe rafan n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">alɔ mangoe rafanma mixi ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="SNG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 2:4" />A bara n xanin a xɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:4">a xa xanunteya bara findi ɲɛlɛxinyi ra n bɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi a xa xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 2:5" />«Donse ɲɔxunmɛ so n yi, n ki mangoe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">barima xanunteya naxan na n bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">a bara n sɛnbɛ ba n yi ra.<verse eid="SNG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 2:6" />N xunyi na n xanuntenyi bɛlɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:6">a na n mafurukufe a yirefanyi ra.»<verse eid="SNG 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi ginɛdimɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 2:7" />«Darisalamu ginɛdimɛe, n bara wo mayandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">tɔɔkɛ nun xeli xili ra naxee na wula i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">wo naxa xanunteya raxunu, wo naxa a rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">beenu a wama a xɔn ma tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi a xa xɛmɛ xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 2:8" />«N xanuntenyi xui na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">a na fafe a gi ra geyae fari.<verse eid="SNG 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 2:9" />A gima alɔ tɔɔkɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">a tuganma alɔ xeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">A na be won ma tɛtɛ xanbi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">a na be matofe wundɛri ra.<verse eid="SNG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 2:10" />A naxa a fala n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:10">‹N xanuntenyi tofanyi, keli, i xa fa,<verse eid="SNG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 2:11" />barima ɲɛmɛ tɛmui bara dangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:11">tunɛ mu birama sɔnɔn.<verse eid="SNG 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 2:12" />Sansi na bogife daaxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">ɲɛlɛxin waxati bara a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">xɔnie na e xui raminife won ma bɔxi ma.<verse eid="SNG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 2:13" />Xɔrɛ bili na bogife,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">wɛni bili na fugafe, a xiri fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">N xanuntenyi, keli, i xa fa.<verse eid="SNG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 2:14" />N ma ginɛ, i naxa i nɔxun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">alɔ ganbɛ a nɔxunma gɛmɛe longori ra ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">Mini, n wama i xui ɲɔxunmɛ mɛfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">n wama i yatagi tofanyi tofe.›»<verse eid="SNG 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi a xa mixie bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 2:15" />«Wo xulumasee suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">naxee wama muxu xa wɛni bili fugaxie kanafe.»<verse eid="SNG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 2:16" />«N xanuntenyi findixi n gbe nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">n fan findixi a gbe nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">A a xa xurusee dɛ madonma sansi fugaxie ya ma.<verse eid="SNG 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 2:17" />N xanuntenyi, beenu kuye xa iba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">i xa gbilen, i xa i gi alɔ tɔɔkɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">i xa i gi geyae fari alɔ xeli.»<verse eid="SNG 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="SNG 3" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛ a xanuntenyi fenfe</para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 3:1" />«Kɔɛ ra n bara n xanuntenyi fen n ma sade ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">kɔnɔ n mu a toxi.<verse eid="SNG 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 3:2" />N naxa keli, n naxa mini taa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">n xa n xanuntenyi to, kɔnɔ n mu a toxi.<verse eid="SNG 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 3:3" />N to taa kantamae li, n naxa e maxɔrin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:3">‹Wo bara n xanuntenyi to?›<verse eid="SNG 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 3:4" />N to dangi e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">n naxa n xanuntenyi li yire nde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">n naxa a suxu, n mu a lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">n naxa a xanin n nga xɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">a xa konkoe kui n barixi dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi ginɛdimɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 3:5" />«Darisalamu ginɛdimɛe, n bara wo mayandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">tɔɔkɛ nun xeli xili ra naxee na wula i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">wo naxa xanunteya raxunu, wo naxa a rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">beenu a wama a xɔn ma tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 3:6" />«Nde na fafe kelife gbengberen yire?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">A na xube ratefe alɔ tuuri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">Na tuuri luxi nɛ alɔ surayi tuuri naxan xiri fan.<verse eid="SNG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 3:7" />Sulemani ragise na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">Isirayila xa sɔɔri gbangbalanyi tongo senni na a matife,<verse eid="SNG 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 3:8" />santidɛgɛma na e birin yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">e fata gere ra, e fata mixi makantade kɔɛ ra.<verse eid="SNG 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 3:9" />Mangɛ Sulemani ragise na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:9">a yailanxi wuri fanyi ra naxan kelixi Liban.<verse eid="SNG 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 3:10" />A raxunmaxi xɛɛma, gbeti, nun dugi gbeeli ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">Darisalamu ginɛe nu bara dugi dɛgɛ Sulemani ragise raxunmafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">mangɛ xa marafanyi xa fe ra.<verse eid="SNG 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 3:11" />Siyon ginɛdimɛe, wo xa mangɛ Sulemani mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">mangɛ tɔnxuma na a xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">a nga naxan soxi a yi ra a xa futi xiri lɔxɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">Na lɔxɔɛ a nu sɛɛwaxi ki fanyi ra.»<verse eid="SNG 3:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="SNG 4" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛ maniyaxi sansi yire nan na</para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 4:1" />«N xanuntenyi, i tofan, i tofan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">I yae rayabu alɔ ganbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">e nɔxunxi mafelenyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">I xunsɛxɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">E luxi nɛ alɔ si gɔɔrɛ naxan goroma Galadi geya fari.<verse eid="SNG 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 4:2" />I ɲinyi fiixɛ alɔ yɛxɛɛ gɔɔrɛ naxan xabe maxabaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">e kelixi maxade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">I ɲinyi keren mu baxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">e birin na e boore sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="SNG 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 4:3" />I dɛ tofan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">i dɛ kiri luxi nɛ alɔ luuti gbeeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">I xɛrɛ tofan alɔ mangoe naxan ixabaxi a tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">E makotoxi i xa mafelenyi kui.<verse eid="SNG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 4:4" />I kɔnyi filinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">a luxi alɔ Dawuda xa yire makantaxi itexi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">I xa kɔnmagore maniyaxi sɔɔrie xa makantasee nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">naxee gbakuxi sɔɔri banxi kanke.<verse eid="SNG 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 4:5" />I xiɲɛ firinyi luxi nɛ alɔ bole xa gulie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">naxee e dɛ madonma sansie tofanyi tagi.<verse eid="SNG 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 4:6" />Soge na goro, kɔɛ naxa so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">n tema nɛ labundɛ nun surayi na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="SNG 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 4:7" />N xanuntenyi, i tofan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:7">sese mu luxi i xa tofanyi ra.<verse eid="SNG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 4:8" />N ma ginɛ, won xa keli Liban,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">won xa keli Liban Amana geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">Seniri nun Xerimon geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">yɛtɛe nun baratɛe na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="SNG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 4:9" />N ma ginɛ, i n sondonyi rasɛɛwama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">N xunya, i na i ya ti n na, n bɔɲɛ ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">I xa kɔnmagore tofe rafan n ma.<verse eid="SNG 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 4:10" />N ma ginɛ, i xa xanunteya ɲɔxun n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">dangife wɛni ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">A xiri fan dangife labundɛ ra.<verse eid="SNG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 4:11" />N ma ginɛ, i dɛ kiri ɲɔxun kumi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">i nɛnyi ɲɔxun dangi kumi nun xiɲɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">I xa dugi xiri luxi nɛ alɔ Liban xiri fanyi.»<verse eid="SNG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 4:12" />«N ma ginɛ, i findixi n gbe nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">alɔ sansi yire tɛtɛ rabilinxi naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">N xunya, i luxi nɛ alɔ n ma kɔlɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">naxan balanxi, mixi gbɛtɛ mu nɔma ye bade naa.<verse eid="SNG 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 4:13" />I fan alɔ sansi yire sansi mɔɔli birin na dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">alɔ mangoe, laali, sansi xiri fanyi,<verse eid="SNG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 4:14" />sansi fuge nerefunyi, wuri bili naxan fuɲi ɲɔxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">wuri bili naxan xiri fan, surayi mɔɔli birin kelixi naxee ma.<verse eid="SNG 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 4:15" />I luxi nɛ alɔ ye naxan minima bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">naxan a niyama Liban sansi birin xa fan.»<verse eid="SNG 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 4:16" />«Foye fanyi xa fa kelife kɔɔla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">kelife yire fanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">alako n ma sansi xiri xa te.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">N xanuntenyi xa fa n yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">a xa sansi bogi fanyi don naxee findixi a gbe ra.»<verse eid="SNG 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="SNG 5" />
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛ xa tofanyi</para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 5:1" />«N xanuntenyi, n bara so n ma sansi yire.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">N xunya, n bara n ma surayi malan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">n bara kumi don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">n bara wɛni nun xiɲɛ min.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">N bara a fala n booree bɛ e fan xa e min,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">e xa xanunteya kolon.»<verse eid="SNG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 5:2" />«N nu na xife, kɔnɔ n bɔɲɛ mu xixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">a n xanuntenyi xui mɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">naxan nu bara naadɛ kɔnkɔn.»</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 5:2">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">«N maaginɛ, n dɔxɔginɛ, naadɛ rabi n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">N ma tɔɔkɛ ginɛ, naxan xa tofanyi maniyɛ mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Xini bara n xunyi xinbeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">a bara n xunsɛxɛ bunda.»<verse eid="SNG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 5:3" />«N ɲan nu bara n ma dugi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">fo n man xa a ragoro n ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">N ɲan nu bara n sanyi maxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">fo n man xa ti bɔxi ma?<verse eid="SNG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 5:4" />N xanuntenyi naxa a bɛlɛxɛ raso naadɛ longori ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:4">alako a xa a rabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:4">N bɔɲɛ naxa sɛɛwa a xa fe ra.<verse eid="SNG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 5:5" />N naxa keli alako n xa naadɛ rabi n xanuntenyi bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">Labundɛ nu na n bɛlɛxɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">ture nu na n bɛlɛxɛsolee ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">Na birin naxa lu naadɛ rabi se ma.<verse eid="SNG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 5:6" />N naxa naadɛ rabi n xanuntenyi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">kɔnɔ a ɲan nu bara siga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">N bɔɲɛ naxa sunnun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">N naxa a fen, kɔnɔ n mu a toxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">N naxa a xili, kɔnɔ a mu n ma xili ratinxi.<verse eid="SNG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 5:7" />Taa kantamae to n to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">e naxa n suxu, e n bɔnbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">e n ma xinbeli dugi muɲa.»<verse eid="SNG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi ginɛdimɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 5:8" />«Darisalamu ginɛdimɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">n bara wo mayandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">xa wo bara n xanuntenyi to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">wo xa a fala a bɛ a xɔli bara n suxu xanunteya xa fe ra.»<verse eid="SNG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛdimɛe xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 5:9" />«Ginɛ tofanyi fisamante,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">i xanuntenyi fan a birin bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">I bara muxu mayandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">barima a fan a birin bɛ?»<verse eid="SNG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi ginɛdimɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 5:10" />«N xanuntenyi kiri fiixɛ, a ragbeeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:10">A kolon ɲɔxun na xɛmɛ wulu fu ya ma.<verse eid="SNG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 5:11" />A xunyi luxi nɛ alɔ xɛɛma fanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">a xunsɛxɛ ifɔɔrɔxi alɔ xaxa fɔɔrɛ xabe.<verse eid="SNG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 5:12" />A yae rayabu alɔ ganbɛ naxee tixi xure dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">e fiixɛ alɔ xiɲɛ, e yanbama alɔ diyaman.<verse eid="SNG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 5:13" />A xɛrɛe luxi nɛ alɔ labundɛ yailande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">a dɛ kiri maniyaxi sansi fuge tofanyi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">a xiri ɲɔxun.<verse eid="SNG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 5:14" />A bɛlɛxɛ tofan alɔ bɛlɛxɛsolerasoe xɛɛma daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">diyaman na naxan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">A fate luxi nɛ alɔ sili ɲinyi fiixɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">gɛmɛ tofanyi mɔɔli nde, yee masoxi naxan ma.<verse eid="SNG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 5:15" />A sanyi sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ fanye fiixɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">naxan tixi xɛɛma fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">A tofan alɔ Liban,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">a ite alɔ sɛdiri wuri bilie.<verse eid="SNG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 5:16" />A dɛ iɲɔxun, a xa fe birin fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">Darisalamu ginɛdimɛe, n xanuntenyi na na ki nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">n dɛ fan boore nan a ra.»<verse eid="SNG 5:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="SNG 6" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛ xa tofanyi</para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛdimɛe xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 6:1" />«Ginɛ tofanyi fisamante, i xanuntenyi sigaxi minden?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">A siga minden mabiri alako won birin xa a fen?»<verse eid="SNG 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi ginɛdimɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 6:2" />«N xanuntenyi bara siga a xa sansi yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">se xiri fanyi na dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">alako a xa a maɲɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">a xa sansi fuge tofanyi nde ba.<verse eid="SNG 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 6:3" />N findixi n xanuntenyi gbe nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">a fan findixi n gbe nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">A luma a maɲɛrɛ ra sansi fuge tofanyie ya ma.»<verse eid="SNG 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 6:4" />«N dɛ fan boore, i tofan alɔ Tirisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">i rayabu alɔ Darisalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">i sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ Isirayila xa sɔɔrie.<verse eid="SNG 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 6:5" />I naxa i ya ti n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">xa na mu a ra n xaxili ifuma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">I xunsɛxɛe gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">E luxi nɛ alɔ si gɔɔrɛ naxan goroma Galadi geya fari.<verse eid="SNG 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 6:6" />I ɲinyi fiixɛ alɔ yɛxɛɛ gɔɔrɛ naxan xabe maxabaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">e kelixi naxee maxade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">I ɲinyi keren mu baxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">e birin dɛɲɛxi.<verse eid="SNG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 6:7" />I xɛrɛ tofan alɔ mangoe naxan ixabaxi a tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:7">E nɔxunxi i xa mafelenyi bun ma.<verse eid="SNG 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 6:8" />Mangɛ ginɛ tongo senni nɔma lude naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">mangɛ xa konyi ginɛ tongo solomasaxan fan lu naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">a nun a xa ginɛdimɛ tofanyi gbegbe naxan kɔnti mu kolon.<verse eid="SNG 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 6:9" />Kɔnɔ ginɛ keren peti nan n yi naxan dangi e birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">A keren nan na a nga bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">naxan nafanxi a ma dangife e birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Ginɛdimɛe, mangɛ ginɛe, nun mangɛ xa ginɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">e birin a matɔxɔma yi wɔyɛnyi ra,<verse eid="SNG 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 6:10" />‹Nde na yi ginɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">naxan yanbama alɔ subaxɛ naiyalanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">naxan tofan alɔ kike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">naxan fate yanbama alɔ soge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">naxan mamirin alɔ tunbui gaali?›»<verse eid="SNG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi a xa futi xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 6:11" />«N wama gorofe sansi yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">alako n xa sansi nɛɛnɛ to gulunba kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">alako n xa a kolon xa wɛni bili bara bogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">xa mangoe bara fuga.<verse eid="SNG 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 6:12" />N mu nu a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:12">xa n yɛtɛ fama tede n ma ɲama xa mangɛ ragise kui.»<verse eid="SNG 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="SNG 7" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛ nun xɛmɛ xa xanunteya</para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛdimɛe xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 7:1" />«Sulamika, i xa gbilen, i xa gbilen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">alako muxu xa i mato.»</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 7:1">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">«Munfe ra wo Sulamika matoma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">a fare boronfe ki naxɛ ɲama ya ma?»<verse eid="SNG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 7:2" />«Mangɛ xa di, i sanyi tofan sankiri kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">I tagi bilinyi rayabu alɔ xunmase mixi naxan yailanxi.<verse eid="SNG 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 7:3" />I furi digilin, a rafexi fe fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">i tagi luxi alɔ mɛngi malanxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">a rabilinxi sansi fuge tofanyie ra.<verse eid="SNG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 7:4" />I xiɲɛ firinyi luxi alɔ xeli xa gulie.<verse eid="SNG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 7:5" />I kɔnyi filinxi, a luxi alɔ yire makantaxi itexi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">naxan yailanxi sili ɲinyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">I yae luxi alɔ ye ragatadee Xɛsibɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">Bati Rabimi naadɛ sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">I ɲɔɛ luxi alɔ Liban xa yire makantaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">naxan ya rafindixi Damasi ma.<verse eid="SNG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 7:6" />I xunyi luxi alɔ Karemele geya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">i xunsɛxɛ luxi alɔ dugi gbeeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">Mangɛ mu nɔma a ya bade naxan na.<verse eid="SNG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 7:7" />N xanuntenyi, i tofan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:7">n xanuntenyi fanyi, i rafan n ma.<verse eid="SNG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 7:8" />I kuya alɔ tugi bili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">i xiɲɛ misaalixi naxan bogie ra.<verse eid="SNG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 7:9" />N bara a fala n yɛtɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">‹N xa te na tugi kɔn na, n xa na bogi suxu.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">I xiɲɛ misaalixi wɛni bili bogi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">i dɛ xiri ɲɔxun alɔ mangoe,<verse eid="SNG 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 7:10" />i dɛ rafan n ma dangife wɛni ra.»</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 7:10">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">«Iyo, a maniyaxi wɛni nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">naxan findixi n xanuntenyi gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">won firin naxan minma.<verse eid="SNG 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 7:11" />N bara findi n xanuntenyi gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:11">a xɔli na n tan nan ma.<verse eid="SNG 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 7:12" />N xanuntenyi, won xa mini daaxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">won xa kɔɛ radangi taa xunxurie kui.<verse eid="SNG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 7:13" />Won kurunma nɛ sigafe ra wɛni bogi bili matode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">won xa a to xa e fugaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">won xa a mato xa mangoe fan fuge bara mini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">Mɛnni n n ma xanunteya masenma nɛ i bɛ.<verse eid="SNG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 7:14" />Xanunteya ɲɔxun alɔ sansi bogi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:14">N na fe fanyi fori nun a nɛɛnɛ ragataxi i tan nan bɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="SNG 8" />
  <para style="s">Xanunteya sɛnbɛ gbo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 8:1" />«Xa i findixi n taara xɛmɛma nan na nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">n nga xiɲɛ fixi naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">n nu nɔma i masunbude mixi ya xɔri n mu yaagima na ra.<verse eid="SNG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 8:2" />N nu nɔma i xaninde n nga yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">i xa findi n karamɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">n fa wɛni fanyi nun mangoe ye so i yi ra.»<verse eid="SNG 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi ginɛdimɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 8:3" />«N xunyi na n xanuntenyi bɛlɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:3">a na n mafurukufe a yirefanyi ra.<verse eid="SNG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 8:4" />Darisalamu ginɛdimɛe, n bara wo mayandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">wo naxa xanunteya raxunu, wo naxa a rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">beenu a wama a xɔn ma tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛdimɛe xa masenyi ginɛ xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 8:5" />«Nde na yi ginɛ ra naxan kelixi gbengberen yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">a a xanuntenyi bɛlɛxɛ suxuxi?»</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 8:5">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">«N bara i raxunu mangoe bili bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">i nga tɔɔrɔxi i baride dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="SNG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 8:6" />N xa findi i keren gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">alɔ i xa tɔnxuma naxan gbakuxi i kɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">xa na mu a ra naxan nasoxi i bɛlɛxɛsole ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">barima xanunteya sɛnbɛ gbo dangife faxɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">N wama i xɔn n yɛtɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">alɔ aligiyama wama mixie xɔn ma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Xanunteya sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ tɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Alatala naxan nadɛxɛxi, a mu xubenma.<verse eid="SNG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 8:7" />Baa ye mu nɔma xanunteya raxubende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">xure ye mu nɔma a bade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">Mixi naxan wama a harige birin masarafe xanunteya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">mixi na kanyi mayelema nɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ taara xɛmɛmae xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 8:8" />«Xunya ginɛma na muxu yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">a mu mɔxi sinden, a xiɲɛe xurun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">Muxu fama munse rabade a bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">mixi na a fen tɛmui naxɛ?<verse eid="SNG 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 8:9" />Xa a luxi alɔ tɛtɛ naxan balanxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">muxu a yɛnsɛma nɛ gbeti ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">kɔnɔ xa a luxi alɔ naadɛ naxan nabixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">muxu a balanma nɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 8:10" />«N tan luxi nɛ alɔ tɛtɛ naxan mu rabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">n xiɲɛe findixi yire makantaxie nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">Na kui n bara findi n xanuntenyi xa bɔɲɛsa ra.<verse eid="SNG 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 8:11" />Wɛni sansi bili yire nu na Sulemani yi ra Bali Hamon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">A naxa a taxu a xa walikɛe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">naxee nu lanma e xa gbeti kɔbiri kole wulu fi na xa fe ra.<verse eid="SNG 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 8:12" />N tan nan n ma wɛni bilie yire makantama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">I bara gbeti kole wulu sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">i xa walikɛe bara gbeti kole kɛmɛ firin sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="SNG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛ xa masenyi ginɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 8:13" />«I tan naxan na sansi yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">i booree wama i xui ramɛfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">kɔnɔ n tan nan na ramɛma.»<verse eid="SNG 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ginɛ xa masenyi xɛmɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 8:14" />«N xanuntenyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">i xa i gi alɔ xeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">i xa i gi alɔ tɔɔkɛ tefe ra geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">surayi ɲɔxunmɛ na dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="SNG 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 8" />
</usx>